      "status": "implemented",
      "change": "静的canonical認定のsuffix shortcutとその内部testを除去。実パスidentityを正本に統一し、nested fixture/別projectを許可。動的書込の既存安全側判定は保持。",
      "regression_tests": [
        "test_canonical_identity_uses_root_not_suffix",
        "test_bash_noncanonical_nested_fixture_and_foreign_project_pass"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F-3004",
      "status": "implemented",
      "change": "install clauseのlegacy title解決とcomponent帰属比較を小helperにし、再導出/保存graph双方へ適用。正当な非install P13 taskのcomponent帰属は許可。",
      "regression_tests": [
        "test_stored_install_obligation_cannot_acquire_component_owner (current/legacy)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F-3005",
      "status": "implemented",
      "change": "既存writer apply/chunkがメモリ上に作る候補stateを既存validate_required_infoへ渡す --required-info を追加し、通過後だけ既存_emitを実行。R2/R3/R5・SKILL3箇所・spec-state契約・question-bankを同じ公開前/後の時点へ整合。旧caller互換のためCLI追加flagはopt-in、現行収集promptはconfirm時に必須。",
      "regression_tests": [
        "test_first_confirm_validates_candidate_before_publishing (apply/chunk)",
        "test_missing_block_answer_rejects_without_changing_any_file (in-place/separate output)",
        "test_reopen_then_reconfirm_uses_new_candidate_grounding"
      ]
    }
